{"id":"wb-1-6","name":"黄花岗七十二烈士墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"黄花岗公园","text":"黄花岗公园（黄花岗七十二烈士墓）位于广东省广州市越秀区黄花岗街道先烈中路，是为了纪念于1911年4月，孙中山领导的同盟会在黄花岗起义中英勇牺牲的七十二位烈士而修建。除了七十二烈士墓之外，墓园内还陆续地修建了王昌墓、邓仲元墓、冯如墓、潘达微墓、史坚如墓和杨仙逸墓。公园现为广州市退役军人事务局直属单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%84%E8%8A%B1%E5%B2%97%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":95419975,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95419975","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/95202040583e01f1a273cb0a.jpg","title":"黄花岗七十二烈士墓.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%BB%84%E8%8A%B1%E5%B2%97%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E7%83%88%E5%A3%AB%E5%A2%93.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/%E9%BB%84%E8%8A%B1%E5%B2%97%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E7%83%88%E5%A3%AB%E5%A2%93.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhou Guanhuai","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Yellow Flower Mound Park and the Mausoleum of the 72 Martyrs, Guangzhou City, Guangdong Province, China.","width":320,"height":240}}